<https://w3id.org/tesseract/industrial-crosswalks/ido-ifc/mapping/024> a sssom:Mapping ;
    rdfs:comment "ASSERTED NON-MAPPING. IDO Object is disjoint from Temporal, so it excludes activities. IFC IfcObject subsumes IfcProcess, so it includes them. Equating the two makes every process both Object and Temporal in IDO, which are declared disjoint. Confidence is in the non-mapping, which is provable. DIVERGENCES.md D1." ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo orcid:0009-0001-7244-794X ;
    sssom:confidence 0.95 ;
    sssom:mapping_justification semapv:ManualMappingCuration ;
    sssom:mapping_set_id <https://w3id.org/tesseract/industrial-crosswalks/ido-ifc> ;
    sssom:object_id ifc:IfcObject ;
    sssom:object_label "IfcObject" ;
    sssom:predicate_id skos:relatedMatch ;
    sssom:predicate_modifier "Not" ;
    sssom:subject_id ido:Object ;
    sssom:subject_label "Object" .

<https://w3id.org/tesseract/industrial-crosswalks/ido-ifc/mapping/025> a sssom:Mapping ;
    rdfs:comment "ASSERTED NON-MAPPING. IDO PhysicalQuantity is a Quality (a Dependent, borne by an object). IfcPhysicalQuantity is a recorded measurement value. IDO declares Dependent disjoint from Object, and its QualityDatum branch sits under Object, so the two cannot be equated. Map IfcPhysicalQuantity to ido:QualityDatum instead. DIVERGENCES.md D4." ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo orcid:0009-0001-7244-794X ;
    sssom:confidence 0.95 ;
    sssom:mapping_justification semapv:ManualMappingCuration ;
    sssom:mapping_set_id <https://w3id.org/tesseract/industrial-crosswalks/ido-ifc> ;
    sssom:object_id ifc:IfcPhysicalQuantity ;
    sssom:object_label "IfcPhysicalQuantity" ;
    sssom:predicate_id skos:exactMatch ;
    sssom:predicate_modifier "Not" ;
    sssom:subject_id ido:PhysicalQuantity ;
    sssom:subject_label "PhysicalQuantity" .

<https://w3id.org/tesseract/industrial-crosswalks/ido-ifc/mapping/026> a sssom:Mapping ;
    rdfs:comment "ASSERTED NON-MAPPING. IDO FunctionalObject and PhysicalObject are NOT disjoint, so one pump is legitimately both. IFC subsumes IfcSystem under IfcGroup, and IfcGroup is declared disjoint from IfcProduct. Equating System with IfcSystem while mapping PhysicalObject to IfcProduct makes any functional-and-physical individual unsatisfiable. DIVERGENCES.md D2." ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo orcid:0009-0001-7244-794X ;
    sssom:confidence 0.9 ;
    sssom:mapping_justification semapv:ManualMappingCuration ;
    sssom:mapping_set_id <https://w3id.org/tesseract/industrial-crosswalks/ido-ifc> ;
    sssom:object_id ifc:IfcSystem ;
    sssom:object_label "IfcSystem" ;
    sssom:predicate_id skos:exactMatch ;
    sssom:predicate_modifier "Not" ;
    sssom:subject_id ido:System ;
    sssom:subject_label "System" .

<https://w3id.org/tesseract/industrial-crosswalks/ido-ifc/mapping/027> a sssom:Mapping ;
    rdfs:comment "ASSERTED NON-MAPPING. IDO Site is a Location, and IDO declares Location disjoint from PhysicalObject. IfcSite is a subclass of IfcProduct, the physical parcel of land. The two sit on opposite sides of IDO's own disjointness. DIVERGENCES.md D3." ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo orcid:0009-0001-7244-794X ;
    sssom:confidence 0.9 ;
    sssom:mapping_justification semapv:ManualMappingCuration ;
    sssom:mapping_set_id <https://w3id.org/tesseract/industrial-crosswalks/ido-ifc> ;
    sssom:object_id ifc:IfcSite ;
    sssom:object_label "IfcSite" ;
    sssom:predicate_id skos:exactMatch ;
    sssom:predicate_modifier "Not" ;
    sssom:subject_id ido:Site ;
    sssom:subject_label "Site" .

<https://w3id.org/tesseract/industrial-crosswalks/ido-ifc/mapping/028> a sssom:Mapping ;
    rdfs:comment "ASSERTED NON-MAPPING. IDO Event is a subclass of Activity that need not be temporally connected: its own definition gives several switch-on occurrences over a week as ONE event individual. IfcEvent is a discrete trigger point, disjoint from IfcTask and IfcProcedure. A scattered aggregate is not a trigger. DIVERGENCES.md D5." ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo orcid:0009-0001-7244-794X ;
    sssom:confidence 0.85 ;
    sssom:mapping_justification semapv:ManualMappingCuration ;
    sssom:mapping_set_id <https://w3id.org/tesseract/industrial-crosswalks/ido-ifc> ;
    sssom:object_id ifc:IfcEvent ;
    sssom:object_label "IfcEvent" ;
    sssom:predicate_id skos:exactMatch ;
    sssom:predicate_modifier "Not" ;
    sssom:subject_id ido:Event ;
    sssom:subject_label "Event" .

<https://w3id.org/tesseract/industrial-crosswalks/ido-ifc/mapping/029> a sssom:Mapping ;
    rdfs:comment "ASSERTED NON-MAPPING. IDO Stream is subsumed by InanimatePhysicalObject: it is the fluid in motion. IfcFlowSegment is a IfcDistributionFlowElement: it is the pipe. Handover tooling that equates them silently swaps contents for containment. DIVERGENCES.md D6." ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo orcid:0009-0001-7244-794X ;
    sssom:confidence 0.9 ;
    sssom:mapping_justification semapv:ManualMappingCuration ;
    sssom:mapping_set_id <https://w3id.org/tesseract/industrial-crosswalks/ido-ifc> ;
    sssom:object_id ifc:IfcFlowSegment ;
    sssom:object_label "IfcFlowSegment" ;
    sssom:predicate_id skos:exactMatch ;
    sssom:predicate_modifier "Not" ;
    sssom:subject_id ido:Stream ;
    sssom:subject_label "Stream" .

<https://w3id.org/tesseract/industrial-crosswalks/ido-ifc/mapping/030> a sssom:Mapping ;
    rdfs:comment "ASSERTED ABSENCE. IDO carries a realisable branch (Potential, Disposition, Capability, Function) with no IFC counterpart at all: IFC has no class for what a thing is FOR, only predefined type enumerations. Recorded so the gap is machine-visible rather than silently unmapped. DIVERGENCES.md D7." ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo orcid:0009-0001-7244-794X ;
    sssom:confidence 0.8 ;
    sssom:mapping_justification semapv:ManualMappingCuration ;
    sssom:mapping_set_id <https://w3id.org/tesseract/industrial-crosswalks/ido-ifc> ;
    sssom:object_id ifc:IfcTypeProduct ;
    sssom:object_label "IfcTypeProduct" ;
    sssom:predicate_id skos:relatedMatch ;
    sssom:predicate_modifier "Not" ;
    sssom:subject_id ido:Function ;
    sssom:subject_label "Function" .

<https://w3id.org/tesseract/industrial-crosswalks/ido-ifc/mapping/031> a sssom:Mapping ;
    rdfs:comment "ASSERTED ABSENCE, as above: the capability layer has no IFC counterpart." ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo orcid:0009-0001-7244-794X ;
    sssom:confidence 0.8 ;
    sssom:mapping_justification semapv:ManualMappingCuration ;
    sssom:mapping_set_id <https://w3id.org/tesseract/industrial-crosswalks/ido-ifc> ;
    sssom:object_id ifc:IfcTypeProduct ;
    sssom:object_label "IfcTypeProduct" ;
    sssom:predicate_id skos:relatedMatch ;
    sssom:predicate_modifier "Not" ;
    sssom:subject_id ido:Capability ;
    sssom:subject_label "Capability" .

ido:Activity skos:closeMatch ifc:IfcProcess .

ido:Actual skos:closeMatch ifc:IfcObject .

ido:Compound skos:closeMatch ifc:IfcMaterial .

ido:Feature skos:closeMatch ifc:IfcFeatureElement .

ido:Interval skos:closeMatch ifc:IfcTimePeriod .

ido:Location skos:relatedMatch ifc:IfcSpatialElement .

ido:Organization skos:closeMatch ifc:IfcOrganization .

ido:Person skos:closeMatch ifc:IfcPerson .

ido:PhysicalArtefact skos:closeMatch ifc:IfcElement .

ido:PhysicalObject skos:closeMatch ifc:IfcProduct .

ido:Quality skos:relatedMatch ifc:IfcProperty .

ido:QualityDatum skos:closeMatch ifc:IfcPhysicalQuantity .

ido:Role skos:relatedMatch ifc:IfcActor .

ido:Scale skos:narrowMatch ifc:IfcNamedUnit .

ido:Specified skos:closeMatch ifc:IfcTypeObject .

ido:UnitOfMeasure skos:closeMatch ifc:IfcNamedUnit .

ido:Event skos:relatedMatch ifc:IfcEvent .

